                <pb facs="1105" n="1025" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg1025"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Pera</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1902-03-20"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 20,
                    1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Leishman states that during a private audience following the Kurban Bairam
                    ceremony on the morning of March 20, His Imperial Majesty the Sultan requested
                    that his compliments and feelings of friendship be conveyed to the President of
                    the United States.)</p>
            </div>
